{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39965","headline":"曲江宴日呈诸同年 · 徐夤","name":"曲江宴日呈诸同年","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹪鹩惊与凤皇同，忽向中兴遇至公。\n金榜连名昇碧落，紫花封勅出琼宫。\n天知惜日迟迟暮，春爲催花旋旋红。\n好是慈恩题了望，白云飞尽塔连空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39965.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39965","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}